<!--
  The nine public pages. Extensionless, to match the canonical on each page and
  the hrefs in the nav — Cloudflare Pages serves both /about and /about.html, and
  listing the other form here would hand search engines a second URL for the same
  content.

  header-lab.html is left out on purpose. It carries a noindex, and it is not
  disallowed in robots.txt, because a crawler has to be able to fetch a page to
  read that tag.

  lastmod is the date the page itself last changed. It is only a hint, and one
  that is ignored if it stops matching what the page actually does, so it wants
  updating when the content does rather than on every deploy.
-->
